    "bbox": [
      83.35,
      581.65,
      547.23,
      627.76
    ],
    "text": "1. The aggregate ineterest receivable by me for the above year of assessment on the monies deposited in thisaccount or any other account of this bank or any other accounts in any other bank or any other financial institutiondoes not exceed Rs. 1,500,000/-. Therefore, please refrain from deducting withholding tax on the interest payableon this account.",
