  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.35,
      640.09,
      547.36,
      686.32
    ],
    "text": "2. The aggregate of the interest receivable by me on the monies deposited in the above account together with thetotal interest receivable by me from any other account of this bank and of any other account in any other bank orany other financial institution may exceed Rs. 1,500,000/- of total interest for the above year of assessment.Therefore, place withhold the tax on the excess of the interest over Rs............................",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.35,
      698.65,
      547.26,
      745.0
    ],
    "text": "3. The tax relief on interest income of Rs. 1,500,000/- which is available to senior citizen has been availed by me inrespect of the interest receivable by me on the monies deposited in the other accounts of this bank or other banksor other financial institutions. Therefore, please withhold tax on the total interest receivable by me from thisaccount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
